.TH KUBERNETES(1) kubernetes User Manuals
Eric Paris
Jan 2015

.SH "نام (NAME)"
kubeadm upgrade node phase \- Use this command to invoke single phase of the "node" workflow


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBkubeadm upgrade node phase\fP [OPTIONS]


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Use this command to invoke single phase of the "node" workflow


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--rootfs\fP=""
	The path to the 'real' host root filesystem. This will cause kubeadm to chroot into the provided path.

.PP
\fB--version\fP=false
	--version, --version=raw prints version information and quits; --version=vX.Y.Z... sets the reported version


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBkubeadm-upgrade-node(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-upgrade-node-phase-addon(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-upgrade-node-phase-control-plane(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-upgrade-node-phase-kubelet-config(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-upgrade-node-phase-post-upgrade(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-upgrade-node-phase-preflight(1)\fP,


.SH "تاریخچه (HISTORY)"
